  "custom_logic_notes": "Buy signals use MA(2,EMA,CLOSE) crossing Envelope lines and MA(220); one buy condition is unusual: MA(2,CLOSE) BELOW Envelopes(0.3) lower on BOTH bar[0] AND bar[1] (not a crossover, a sustained below condition). Sell signals use MA(2,EMA,OPEN) crossing Envelope lines and MA(220). The entry conditions are OR-combined: any single condition triggers a trade. Position gate is total==0 (completely flat, no open positions at all). If both InpTrailingStopBuy and InpTrailingStopSell are 0, the EA returns early and never checks for entry signals. The time filter uses InpFrom/InpTo hours with inclusive bounds. InpTrailingStep is not declared as 'input' (missing input keyword on line 54).",
